// Recall keeps the catalog line whose query overlaps the caller most.
// A tie keeps the earlier pair. Zero overlap returns nothing.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE recall ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG recall rank

IMPULSE recall 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "recall" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
